OL,3,GNEWSACharges over disorder as Raise the
OL,4,AColours put up flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged by police
OL,7,Fafter disorder broke out in Birmingham
OL,8,Fas campaign group Raise the Colours
OL,9,Fattempted to attach St George's flags
OL,10,Fto lamp-posts.
OL,12,FThe incident happened on Mayfield Road,
OL,13,Fjust off Pershore Road, in Stirchley,
OL,14,Fon 14 May.
OL,16,FMark Keating, 49, from Tamworth, has
OL,17,Fbeen charged with four counts of
OL,18,Fassault by beating, West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
